  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Safety Capacity Building IDF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Objective of the Grant is to assist the Government of Armenia in functions directed to institutional and policy analyses capacity building and management of human resources in the field of food safety.  The specific areas of focus will include: (i) improvement of the legal framework to approximate the international and EU food safety requirements, (ii) identification of key knowledge gaps of the staff responsible for developing and implementing food safety regulations; development and provision of adapted initial and continuing training programs, (iii) development of capacities to conduct risk analysis as well as economic analysis in order to enable decision-makers to justify food safety policies and technical decisions, nationally and internationally in accordance with WTO/SPS principles. TF012224</narrative>
  </description>
